<title>FRANCE: Cades to issue 10 bln ffr 2000 bond, spd 4-6 bp.</title>
<headline>Cades to issue 10 bln ffr 2000 bond, spd 4-6 bp.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>French welfare debt repayment fund CADES said on Tuesday it would sell 10 billion francs of a new October 12, 2000 bond on January 22 with a spread of four to six basis points over the October 12, 2000 BTAN.</p>
<p>CADES said in a statement the issue would be lead-managed by Banque Paribas and Societe Generale. The payment date will be February 3.</p>
<p>CADES gave no details about the coupon the bond will carry.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
